{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16215280","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16215280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1621528001:1":{"text":"멍멍달, 저항해 봤자 소용없어. 폭풍의 포효를 느껴봐!","source_cn":"汪达尔，你的抵抗毫无意义，感受风暴的怒吼吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6CAB3EFC9CABB34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621528002:1":{"text":"날카로운 바람의 칼날이 멍멍달을 향해 덮쳐왔다. 하지만 멍멍달은 시선을 피하지 않고 재빨리 몸을 틀었다.","source_cn":"一股凌厉的风刃劈向汪达尔，他迅速侧身躲避，目光坚定不屈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE258C2F8E23E2892","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621528003:1":{"text":"젠장, 바람이...","source_cn":"可恶！这风……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63DA8D30BF15148B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1621528003":{"text":"젠장, 바람이...","source_cn":"可恶！这风……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63DA8D30BF15148B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621528004:1":{"text":"안 돼... 내 바람 마법이 이렇게 쉽게...","source_cn":"不……我的风魔法这么轻易就……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76458CD0D08D6EB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_stat